  "readme": [
    {
      "section": "dsh-adb-ultimate",
      "text": "[English](README.md) · [中文](README.zh.md)\n\n[](https://www.npmjs.com/package/dsh-adb-ultimate)\n[](https://github.com/newborne/dsh-adb-ultimate)\n[](https://opensource.org/licenses/MIT)\n\nFull-featured ADB device management plugin for [DeepSeek Harness (DSH)](https://github.com/deepseek-ai/deepseek-harness)."
    },
    {
      "section": "🚀 Project Motivation",
      "text": "I have a Linux environment called **DROID** running on my Android tablet, with **DSH** deployed in it.\n\n> As a tech enthusiast, I wanted to **control my device with AI** to achieve \"self-control\" — letting AI:\n> - See the device's real-time screen\n> - Execute any system operations\n> - Automatically manage apps and files on the device\n> - Monitor system performance and status\n> - ..."
    },
    {
      "section": "🚀 Project Motivation",
      "text": "With this idea, **dsh-adb-ultimate** was born. It enables DSH to fully control Android devices through the ADB protocol, truly realizing \"AI as your phone assistant\"."
    },
    {
      "section": "📱 Device Panel",
      "text": "Embeds a complete device management panel in the DSH session with 5 tabs:\n\n| Tab | Features |\n|-----|----------|\n| 🖥️ **Screen** | Real-time device screen monitoring with play/pause (1s interval) |\n| 📊 **Performance** | Real-time memory, CPU, battery status (auto-refresh) |\n| 📋 **Info** | Device model, Android version, serial number, etc. |\n| 📦 **Apps** | Browse, search, view app details (version, permissions) |\n| 📝 **Logs** | Real-time logcat output with V/D/I/W/E level filtering |"
    },
    {
      "section": "🔌 Device Connection",
      "text": "- **WiFi Connect** - Connect to Android device via IP address\n- **WiFi Pair** - Support pairing verification for first-time connections\n- **Connection History** - Auto-save history for quick reconnect\n- **Multi-device** - Manage multiple devices simultaneously"
    },
    {
      "section": "🎮 Device Control",
      "text": "- **Screen** - Screenshot, screen on/off, real-time monitoring\n- **Input** - Tap, swipe, text input, key events\n- **Apps** - Install, uninstall, launch, force stop\n- **File** - Push/pull files"
    },
    {
      "section": "📊 Performance Monitoring",
      "text": "- **Memory** - Real-time RAM usage\n- **Battery** - Level, temperature, health status\n- **CPU** - Cores, processor model"
    },
    {
      "section": "🔧 System Debug",
      "text": "- **Logcat** - Real-time log output with level filtering\n- **Dumpsys** - Query system service info\n- **Getprop** - Read system properties\n- **Shell** - Execute shell commands directly"
    },
    {
      "section": "Install",
      "text": "> 💡 Copy any install command below and give it to Agent for automatic installation"
    },
    {
      "section": "Way 1: GitHub Install",
      "text": "```bash\ndsh plugin --profile web add github:newborne/dsh-adb-ultimate\n```"
    },
    {
      "section": "Way 2: Local Install",
      "text": "```bash"
    },
    {
      "section": "Clone the repo",
      "text": "git clone https://github.com/newborne/dsh-adb-ultimate.git"
    },
    {
      "section": "Install to DSH",
      "text": "dsh plugin --profile web add /path/to/dsh-adb-ultimate\n```"
    },
    {
      "section": "Way 3: Natural Language Install",
      "text": "Just tell Agent:\n> \"Help me install this plugin: https://github.com/newborne/dsh-adb-ultimate\""
    },
    {
      "section": "1. Tablet Configuration",
      "text": "Enable WiFi ADB debugging on your tablet:"
    },
    {
      "section": "2. Plugin Overview",
      "text": "DSH Web UI embeds a complete device management panel:"
    },
    {
